  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nafasi Art Space - Core support to Strategic Plan 2016-2020</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core support to Nafasi Art Space for implementation of their Strategic Plan 2016-2020.
Impact: Protection and strengthening of cultural rights in Tanzania.
Outcomes: Increased independent art production and presentation. 
Increased education and exchange between Tanzanian artist and the local,regional and international art world.
Increased visibility for contemporary art in Tanzania. 
A sustainable and independent art institution drives innovation and excellence in the Tanzanian art sector.</narrative>
  </description>
